---
---

<section id="infrastructure" class="section-surface-strong">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <p class="eyebrow">Infrastructure</p>
      <h2>Infrastructure planned for rollout, operations, and growth.</h2>
      <p>
        CloudBridge builds satellite-based infrastructure for African hospitals, institutions,
        businesses, and remote sites that need dependable service.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="infrastructure-flow" aria-label="CloudBridge build path">
      <div class="infrastructure-flow-header">
        <p class="eyebrow">What we build</p>
        <h3>From satellite backhaul to live site operations.</h3>
        <p>
          Each deployment is designed as one connected delivery path, not separate vendors
          for the link, the local network, and the systems that keep service running.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="build-grid">
        <article class="build-step">
          <div class="build-step-top">
            <p class="build-step-index">01</p>
            <p class="build-step-label">Network layer</p>
          </div>
          <h3>Satellite backhaul</h3>
          <p>Primary connectivity for remote and underserved sites.</p>
          <div class="build-step-rows">
            <div>
              <span>Link type</span>
              <strong>Primary satellite route</strong>
            </div>
            <div>
              <span>Best for</span>
              <strong>Weak terrestrial coverage</strong>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="build-step">
          <div class="build-step-top">
            <p class="build-step-index">02</p>
            <p class="build-step-label">Control layer</p>
          </div>
          <h3>Edge and routing</h3>
          <p>On-site equipment configured around traffic, power, and site conditions.</p>
          <div class="build-step-rows">
            <div>
              <span>Handles</span>
              <strong>Traffic and failover</strong>
            </div>
            <div>
              <span>Placed for</span>
              <strong>Site-specific constraints</strong>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="build-step">
          <div class="build-step-top">
            <p class="build-step-index">03</p>
            <p class="build-step-label">Coverage layer</p>
          </div>
          <h3>Site network</h3>
          <p>Coverage across wards, offices, branches, and shared working areas.</p>
          <div class="build-step-rows">
            <div>
              <span>Rollout</span>
              <strong>Indoor and campus coverage</strong>
            </div>
            <div>
              <span>Output</span>
              <strong>Usable service across the site</strong>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="build-step">
          <div class="build-step-top">
            <p class="build-step-index">04</p>
            <p class="build-step-label">Operating layer</p>
          </div>
          <h3>Billing and operations</h3>
          <p>Usage rules, monitoring, and service workflows handled under one system.</p>
          <div class="build-step-rows">
            <div>
              <span>Includes</span>
              <strong>Billing and access control</strong>
            </div>
            <div>
              <span>Keeps</span>
              <strong>Service continuity in view</strong>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>

      <p class="infrastructure-summary">
        CloudBridge stays responsible from first link design to day-to-day service continuity.
      </p>
    </div>

    <figure class="media-figure is-wide infrastructure-media" data-reveal>
      <img
        src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1558494949-ef010cbdcc31?w=1400&q=80&auto=format&fit=crop"
        alt="Network and server equipment running managed connectivity infrastructure"
        loading="lazy"
      />
    </figure>

    <div class="capabilities-section">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <p class="eyebrow">Capabilities</p>
        <h2>Our core services at a glance</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="capabilities-grid">
        <article class="capability-item">
          <p class="capability-index">01</p>
          <h3>Satellite backhaul</h3>
          <p>Primary connectivity for facilities where terrestrial options are weak, unstable, or unavailable.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="capability-item">
          <p class="capability-index">02</p>
          <h3>On-site network design</h3>
          <p>Coverage planning for facilities, campuses, branch locations, and high-use operational areas.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="capability-item">
          <p class="capability-index">03</p>
          <h3>Billing and access control</h3>
          <p>Where the project needs it, we handle billing, user access flows, and platform-side operations.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="capability-item">
          <p class="capability-index">04</p>
          <h3>Remote deployment</h3>
          <p>Installations in areas where access, logistics, and maintenance windows require careful planning.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="capability-item">
          <p class="capability-index">05</p>
          <h3>Monitoring and support</h3>
          <p>Post-deployment follow-up so a live site stays usable after handover.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="capability-item">
          <p class="capability-index">06</p>
          <h3>Ongoing operations</h3>
          <p>Monitoring, issue follow-up, and practical support once the network is in service.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  #infrastructure {
    background: var(--color-background);
    padding-top: var(--space-96);
    padding-bottom: var(--space-96);
  }

  .infrastructure-flow {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-96);
  }

  .infrastructure-flow-header {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-12);
    max-width: 760px;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-48);
  }

  .infrastructure-flow-header h3 {
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 3vw, 2.75rem);
    line-height: 1.1;
  }

  .build-grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-24);
  }

  .build-step {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-16);
    min-height: 200px;
    padding-top: var(--space-16);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .build-step-top {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: var(--space-12);
    align-items: center;
  }

  .build-step-index,
  .capability-index {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .build-step h3,
  .capability-item h3 {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-8);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .build-step-label {
    color: var(--color-subtle);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  .build-step p,
  .capability-item p {
    color: var(--color-muted);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  .build-step-rows {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-8);
    margin-top: auto;
    padding-top: var(--space-8);
  }

  .build-step-rows div {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-4);
    padding-top: var(--space-8);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .build-step-rows span {
    color: var(--color-subtle);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
  }

  .build-step-rows strong {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .infrastructure-summary {
    margin-top: var(--space-48);
    padding: var(--space-16) 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border-strong);
    color: var(--color-text);
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .infrastructure-media {
    margin-top: var(--space-48);
  }

  /* Capabilities */
  .capabilities-section {
    margin-top: var(--space-96);
    padding-top: var(--space-48);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .capabilities-grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-32);
    margin-top: var(--space-48);
  }

  .capability-item {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-12);
    padding-top: var(--space-16);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  @media (min-width: 760px) {
    .build-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }

    .capabilities-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }

    .build-step-rows div {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: var(--space-16);
    }

    .build-step-rows strong {
      text-align: right;
    }
  }

  @media (min-width: 1080px) {
    .capabilities-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }
  }

  @media (min-width: 1180px) {
    .build-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }
  }
</style>
